    "de": [
      "Fitnesscenter, Schlankheitszentrum: Cellu M6, Kryolipolyse, Kryotherapie, Coaching für Einzelunterricht. Fitness (Bodypump, Zumba, Crosstraining, Kardio-Boxen, Rpm, Bauch-/Gesäßmuskeltraining).\r\nWassersportbereich, Aquabike, Wassergymnastik. Schwimmkurse, BB Schwimmer"
    ],
    "en": [
      "Weight loss and fitness center. Advanced techniques: Cellu M6, Powerplate. Studio coaching with private lessons. Fitness center, slimming center with advanced techniques: Cellu M6, Powerplate. Studio coaching with private lessons. Fitness (bodypump, bodyjam, rpm, step, abs/glutes), babygym, fitness kids/teens. Zumba."
    ],
    "it": [
      "Centro fitness, centro dimagrimento: Cellu M6, criolipolisi, crioterapia, lezioni private di coaching. Fitness (bodypump, zumba, cross training, cardio boxe, rpm, addominali/glutei).\r\nArea acquatica, aquabike, aquagym. Lezioni di nuoto, nuotatori BB"
    ],
    "fr": [
      "Centre remise en forme, centre amincissement: Cellu M6, cryolipolyse, cryothérapie coaching cours particuliers. Fitness (bodypump, zumba, cross Training, cardio boxe, rpm, abdos/fessiers).\r\nEspace aquatique, aquabike, aquagym. Cours de natation, BB nageurs"
    ],
    "es": [
      "Gimnasio, centro de adelgazamiento: Cellu M6, criolipólisis, clases particulares de coaching con crioterapia. Fitness (bodypump, zumba, cross training, cardio boxing, rpm, abdominales/glúteos).\r\nZona acuática, aquabike, aquagym. Clases de natación, nadadores BB"
